{"id":"kuhnde-s-mantis","name":"Kuhnde's mantis","type":"creature","aliases":["the mantis"],"description":"The giant mantis Kuhnde has ridden for twenty years; it is burned fatally by the phoenix and killed by Kuhnde.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-10-08","last_seen":"2014-10-08","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e0","era":null,"summary":"Kuhnde, a Jeskai monk, stands atop his mantis on a tower and watches the valley, vigilant against the mount he rides.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"minor","page":"stories/way-of-the-mantis","order":466,"story_date":"2014-10-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":1,"quote":"Atop a red-roofed Jeskai tower, a monk named Kuhnde stood on his mantis and looked over the valley.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=Atop%20a%20red%2Droofed%20Jeskai,looked%20over%20the%20valley.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=Atop%20a%20red%2Droofed%20Jeskai,looked%20over%20the%20valley.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e2","era":null,"summary":"In a flashback, Kuhnde meets his mount on the same day; a rider shows him how dangerous a mantis is when a freed tether lets it cut the rider's hand.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"minor","page":"stories/way-of-the-mantis","order":466,"story_date":"2014-10-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":4,"quote":"The rider removed one of the mantis's tethers and the insect lashed out, cutting the rider's hand.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=The%20rider%20removed%20one,cutting%20the%20rider%27s%20hand.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=The%20rider%20removed%20one,cutting%20the%20rider%27s%20hand.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e3","era":null,"summary":"Kuhnde's mantis alerts him to a concealed amber orb of energy racing up the mountain, and he signals the mantis to intercept it.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis","the-phoenix"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"minor","page":"stories/way-of-the-mantis","order":466,"story_date":"2014-10-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"Kuhnde's mantis turned its head, alerting him to movement near the base of the mountain.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=Kuhnde%27s%20mantis%20turned%20its,base%20of%20the%20mountain.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=Kuhnde%27s%20mantis%20turned%20its,base%20of%20the%20mountain.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e4","era":null,"summary":"Kuhnde leads the orb away from the monastery toward the valley lakes, then turns back and jabs it with his spear.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"minor","page":"stories/way-of-the-mantis","order":466,"story_date":"2014-10-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"He signaled the mantis to go lower, so they could lead the energy ball away from the monastery.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=He%20signaled%20the%20mantis,away%20from%20the%20monastery.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=He%20signaled%20the%20mantis,away%20from%20the%20monastery.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kuhnde has the mantis take the phoenix's attack and the mantis wounds the phoenix, which flees toward the monastery's library tower.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis","the-phoenix"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"minor","page":"stories/way-of-the-mantis","order":466,"story_date":"2014-10-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"It cut the phoenix with its longer claws, and blood and flame emerged from the wound.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=It%20cut%20the%20phoenix,emerged%20from%20the%20wound.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=It%20cut%20the%20phoenix,emerged%20from%20the%20wound.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e8","era":null,"summary":"Kuhnde impales the phoenix with his spear, but its flames burn the mantis's wings and both creatures fall and slide down the mountainside.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis","the-phoenix"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"major","page":"stories/way-of-the-mantis","order":466,"story_date":"2014-10-08","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":14,"quote":"His mantis began to fall and he knew why before he saw—its wings were burning.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=His%20mantis%20began%20to,saw%E2%80%94its%20wings%20were%20burning.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Way of the Mantis","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-08","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/way-of-the-mantis#:~:text=His%20mantis%20began%20to,saw%E2%80%94its%20wings%20were%20burning.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Way of the Mantis\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 8 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"way-of-the-mantis-e9","era":null,"summary":"Kuhnde finds his mantis of twenty years dying and still trying to kill him.","participants":["kuhnde","kuhnde-s-mantis"],"location":"jeskai-monastery","importance":"minor","pa